      en: ["Perast features 16 Baroque palaces and 19 churches.", "The bell tower of St. Nicholas Church stands 55 meters high.", "The town remained under Venetian rule from 1420 until 1797.", "The island of Our Lady of the Rocks was created artificially.", "In the 18th century, Perast maintained a fleet of over 100 merchant ships.", "Marko Martinović founded one of the Adriatic's first naval schools here."],
